    "4_patient_rate_uncertainty": {
      "content": "The fit-precision receipt bootstraps the patient's own observations to give a k_day interval, a percentile interval and a decline-sign stability fraction. At exactly three distinct observation days it is not estimable and every interval is null with status INSUFFICIENT_FOR_UNCERTAINTY.",
